  "content": "<a href=\"/#portofolio\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M257.5 445.1l-22.2 22.2c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 273c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.4 44.7c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.2 22.2c9.5 9.5 9.3 25-.4 34.3L136.6 216H424c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v32c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24H136.6l120.5 114.8c9.8 9.3 10 24.8.4 34.3z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Project &gt;</p><p>Poster Design</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Infographic Poster Design</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>I design data-driven posters that turn complex information into visually engaging stories. With a strong focus on clarity, hierarchy, and design flow, these posters are made to be informative, shareable, and visually striking. Perfect for education, research, presentations, or social campaigns.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>📚 Poster Type</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEducational Infographics\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch  Posters\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAwareness Campaigns\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEvent Infographic\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🎯 Target Audience</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStudents\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tProfessionals\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPublic\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHealthcare\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAttendees\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"517e353\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"3\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTQ3LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wva2hhaXJhbi50ZWNoXC93cC1jb250ZW50XC91cGxvYWRzXC8yMDI1XC8wNlwvMy0xLndlYnAiLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiI1MTdlMzUzIn0%3D\" hre